{"status":"recorded-awaiting-edit","blocks":[{"id":1,"text":"If I unpack, it means I'm staying. If I stay, somebody will eventually ask why I came. And what am I supposed to tell them? That I drove halfway across the country because every street back home still knows his name?"},{"id":2,"text":"You said you'd call tomorrow. You always called. I don't understand how the world can keep moving when you've stopped. I don't know what I'm supposed to do with all the things I haven't told you."},{"id":3,"text":"Somewhere nobody knows him. That's all I asked for. One evening where I can just be the woman ordering a drink, instead of the woman with the dead brother."},{"id":4,"text":"Who are you?\n\nYou look like the kind of man who has an answer prepared for everything, and not one of them is the truth.\n\nDon't start. Don't make somebody else's silence into your problem.\n\nSo why haven't you looked away?"}],"rawText":"If I unpack, it means I'm staying. If I stay, somebody will eventually ask why I came. And what am I supposed to tell them? That I drove halfway across the country because every street back home still knows his name?\n\nYou said you'd call tomorrow. You always called. I don't understand how the world can keep moving when you've stopped. I don't know what I'm supposed to do with all the things I haven't told you.\n\nSomewhere nobody knows him. That's all I asked for. One evening where I can just be the woman ordering a drink, instead of the woman with the dead brother.\n\nWho are you?\n\nYou look like the kind of man who has an answer prepared for everything, and not one of them is the truth.\n\nDon't start. Don't make somebody else's silence into your problem.\n\nSo why haven't you looked away?","voice":"Hallie – Gentle & Expressive","absoluteGain":0.8,"url":"https://resource2.heygen.ai/text_to_speech/614a49c8312e4000b7232bd515dc476e/8f71d16d1fa84544a4db41a18264d613/id=a8c18990b19941ee94db33fca2b3d106.wav","duration":43.14342403628118,"chars_timing":[[0.299,